WEBVTT

00:28:27.829 --> 00:28:31.038
and certainly people who have written
to me as sugar, you know,

00:28:31.038 --> 00:28:33.371
they have a problem. They write
with the problem right there.

00:28:33.371 --> 00:28:34.996
Like, this is my question.
This is my thing.

00:28:35.163 --> 00:28:37.413
But really, the problem is, is that deep,

00:28:37.413 --> 00:28:39.663
deep river that's flowing beneath all

00:28:39.663 --> 00:28:46.121
the troubles that that subterranean
channel, that that is your parents,

00:28:46.121 --> 00:28:48.704
that is those early stories you received,

00:28:49.371 --> 00:28:51.788
your losses and your gains
and your wounds

00:28:51.788 --> 00:28:54.579
and your sorrows that you have
to you have to heal them.

00:28:54.579 --> 00:28:57.829
And sometimes, you know, healing
is an ugly thing.

00:28:58.288 --> 00:29:02.329
Sometimes healing is destruction.
Sometimes healing is turning away.